<Base title="Alcohol Detox in Santa Ana" description="Medically supervised alcohol detox in Orange County. In-network PPO withdrawal management. Do not detox from daily drinking alone if withdrawal has been dangerous before." path="/detox/alcohol-detox/" keywords="alcohol detox Santa Ana, alcohol detox Orange County, in network alcohol detox PPO">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Detox / Alcohol</p>
    <h1>Alcohol detox</h1>
    <p class="lede">Medically supervised withdrawal from alcohol at our Santa Ana campus. Seizure risk is why this is a medical service, not a long weekend.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <p>If someone is seizing, unconscious, or severely confused, call 911. If you are planning detox and drink daily, call admissions. We verify PPO benefits and time arrival. Related: <a href="/treatments/alcohol-rehab/">alcohol rehab</a> and <a href="/programs/detox/">detox program</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
  <CtaBand />
</Base>
